{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04487","headline":"卧病家园 · 陈子昂","name":"卧病家园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世上无名子，人间岁月赊。\n纵横策已弃，寂寞道爲家。\n卧病谁能问，闲居空物华。\n犹忆灵台友，栖真隐太霞。\n还丹奔日御，却老饵云芽。\n宁知白社客，不厌青门瓜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}